  "max_pressure_psf": 70.0,
  "max_frame_height_in": 121.25,
  "governing": "Pressure is controlled by the vertical framing members/mullions and their end anchor quantities (sheet 2 'Allowable design pressure'). There are no separate head, sill, horizontal or glass pressure tables; glass is limited by the D.L.O. size table.",
  "frame_height": "Frame height up to 121-1/4\" (90\" max when project-out windows are present).",
  "load_width": "Intermediate mullion: glass centerline to glass centerline (= tributary width). Side jamb: frame edge to first glass centerline. Corner: greater of the two sides A and B.",
  "anchors": "Intermediate mullion: 6 anchors per end shown, 4 may apply (use the matching column). Side jamb: 3 per end shown, 2 may apply. Corner mullion: 6 end anchors. Strap anchors not applicable at sill. Side jamb anchors at mid-height: 3\" from center (6\" with CMU).",
  "side_jamb_screws": "No side jamb frame screws required if unit frame height is 90\" or less or if the 5\" jamb is used (sheet 2).",
  "expansion": "Recommended expansion mullion every 20 ft max. across openings over 20 ft wide.",
  "members": "Jamb 2-3/4\" or 5\"; intermediate mullion 2-3/4\" standard (item 8) or 3\" expansion (items 9/10); mid-rail 2-3/4\"; head option 1 or 2; sill frame; sub-sill optional (sheet 8/10).",
  "shims": "3/8\" max shim at each frame screw anchor; 1/4\" max at each strap anchor (min. 6\" x 3\" shim).",
  "general_notes": [
   "Design pressures may not exceed the 'Allowable design pressure' tables (note 1).",
   "Openings, bucking and bucking fasteners by others, designed to transfer loads (note 2).",
   "Anchor embedment must be beyond wall finish or stucco (note 3).",
   "Anchors into pressure treated wood must resist corrosion (note 6).",
   "Kd = 0.85 directionality factor may be applied per ASCE 7 (note 7).",
   "Horizontal stacking and overall unit width unlimited if dimensions are not exceeded; vertically stacked lites unlimited within max unit height (sheet 2)."
  ],
